","properties":{"layer_id":"cultural_facilities","name":"七宗町町民運動場","category":"public","address":"上麻生3556","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"21504","municipality_pref":"岐阜県","municipality_name":"七宗町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.110814,35.555902]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"飛水峡甌穴群","category":"nature","address":"河川景観 / 河川 甌穴群","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"21504","municipality_pref":"岐阜県","municipality_name":"七宗町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"609"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.115966796875,35.529930114746094]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"飛水峡","category":"nature","address":"河川景観 / 穿入蛇行河川","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"21504","municipality_pref":"岐阜県","municipality_name":"七宗町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"604"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.16064453125,35.54391098022461]}}],"display_comment_original":"七宗町周辺には、近世村の記憶として上吉田村、上麻生村、大橋村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には史跡や遺跡、寺社や信仰の場に関わる場所が見え、下麻生役所跡、柿ヶ野番所跡、葉津番所跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、上吉田村、上麻生村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":[],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["飛水峡","日本最古の石博物館","神淵神社","七宗町蒸気機関車展示館（C12 163を展示）","眞光寺","龍門寺","寶生寺","東禅寺"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%83%E5%AE%97%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"七宗町","wikipedia_revision_id":"109788004","wikidata_qid":"Q1203839","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%83%E5%AE%97%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}